{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZNRHZZzi5b1793490404.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本三重縣外海發生6.1級地震，當局沒有發出海嘯警報。</p><p></p><p>日本氣象廳消息，本州三重縣東南部海域，當地早上7時15分發生地震，震源深度約350公里，震央位於名古屋南面約160公里。氣象廳稱不會引發海嘯。</p><p></p><p>本港天文台及美國地質勘探局亦錄得這次地震，強度為6級。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.851615+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T23:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:49:06.700795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:02.557757+00:00","content_hash":"318c41ce8f492ddb1ff21ea84869591b628405e1503d447a7036f98bf3d1360e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.851615+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}